<title>CHINA: Shanghai Rubber Belt to buy factory.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Rubber Belt to buy factory.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shanghai Rubber Belt Co Ltd will buy a rubber product factory in Nanchang, Jiangxi province, the Shanghai Securities News said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The company has signed an agreement to acquire Nanchang Rubber Product Plant, which has total assets of 50.14 million yuan, to help expand its production in central China, the newspaper said.</p>
<p>The move needs the approval of the company's shareholders, the newspaper said. It gave no further details.</p>
